      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786910156729,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Metrics, labels, and time series are fundamental concepts in Prometheus.\n\nCloud Native Computing\nFoundation (CNCF) Project\nA CNCF project for monitoring\nand time-series data\n\nMetrics Recording\nRecords performance data with time stamps\n\nCommunity Value\nRecognized as a valuable asset in the community\n\nLabels\nProvides context through key-value pairs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Metrics, labels, and time series are fundamental concepts in Prometheus.\n\nCloud Native Computing\nFoundation (CNCF) Project\nA CNCF project for monitoring\nand time-series data\n\nMetrics Recording\nRecords performance data with time stamps\n\nCommunity Value\nRecognized as a valuable asset in the community\n\nLabels\nProvides context through key-value pairs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
